DigestCacheLib::isAlreadyVerified
├── when digest is not cached
│   └── it returns false
├── when digest is cached
│   └── it returns true
└── given different parameters
    ├── when different accounts
    │   └── it returns isolated results per account
    ├── when different permissions
    │   └── it returns isolated results per permission
    └── when different digests
        └── it returns isolated results per digest